# D47 (25 Nov 2026): Spring Framework 6.2.19 (Spring Boot 3.5.16, the last open-source 3.5.x) — fixed only in
# Spring Framework 7.0.9 / Spring Boot 4. Neither flaw is reachable here: the application registers no XsltView and
# streams no Server-Sent Events (SseEmitter / ResponseBodyEmitter / ServerSentEvent). UnreachableSpringCveArchTest
# fails the build if either appears. The Spring Boot 4 migration (WP-55) removes these entries.
